         per-app "Local Network" permission; this string is what its prompt
         shows. Without the key an ad-hoc-signed app is often denied silently,
         never appearing in the settings list at all. -->
    <key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
    <string>rudbgen connects to database servers and SSH hosts on your local network to read their metadata.</string>
    <key>NSSupportsAutomaticGraphicsSwitching</key>
    <true/>
